{"a": "Don't use testify/assert, use table-driven stdlib tests", "b": "no testify please. table-driven tests, standard library only", "same": true}
{"a": "Write table-driven tests with the standard library, not testify/assert", "b": "Use stdlib table-driven tests instead of the testify assert package", "same": true}
